# Hauntwoods Shrieker: "Reveal target face-down permanent" is any player's (CR 115.1, 708.2), and the Shrieker's controller turns it up
# (CR 701.40b), not the permanent's controller. Both players cast a Shrieker with Black Lotus (Bot1 on turn 1, Bot2 on turn 2).
# On turn 4 Bot2's Shrieker attacks and its trigger manifests dread for Bot2: Grizzly Bears goes face down, Lightning Bolt to the
# graveyard. Bot1 then activates its own Shrieker ({1}{G} from the Moxen it left untapped) on Bot2's face-down permanent, is asked
# whether to turn it up and does: a Grizzly Bears under Bot2's control. Bot1 takes 3 from the attack.

